## Package Layering

Dependencies flow downward. Nothing below may import from above.

```
┌─────────────────────────┐
│     Presentation        │  UI, CLI, API handlers
├─────────────────────────┤
│     Application         │  Use cases, orchestration
├─────────────────────────┤
│     Domain              │  Business logic, entities
├─────────────────────────┤
│     Infrastructure      │  DB, external services, I/O
└─────────────────────────┘
```

> Customize layers to match your actual project structure.

